        "TileImage": "$($repository fa0b9f07-d667-48d2-99c0-c5ee905fa973).Image",
        "Description": "Master Bruce,\rI have successfully infiltrated the estate, posing as new help. They have replaced many of the staff, and even supplanted yours truly as head of staff. This shoddy replacement, along with one Rebecca Carlisle, hold the 2 halves of your family crest. I shall reobtain then posthaste and we shall use Bruce Wayne, rather than Batman, to do the rest.\r Back in time for tea,\rA",
